                "command": "cd /home/marcus/StellPoker && gh pr create \\\n  --repo HitEmPoka/StellPoker \\\n  --head MarcusDavidG:feat/emergency-pause-mechanism \\\n  --base main \\\n  --title \"feat: add emergency pause mechanism to poker-table, zk-verifier, committee-registry\" \\\n  --body \"Closes #33\n\n## Summary\n\nAdds an admin-only emergency pause mechanism to all three contracts so that operations can be halted instantly if a vulnerability is discovered, without redeploying.\n\n## Changes\n\n### \\`contracts/poker-table/src/types.rs\\`\n- Added \\`ContractPaused = 37\\` to \\`PokerTableError\\`\n- Added \\`Paused(u32)\\` variant to \\`DataKey\\` (per-table flag in instance storage)\n\n### \\`contracts/poker-table/src/lib.rs\\`\n- Added \\`require_not_paused\\` helper\n- Added admin-only \\`pause\\`, \\`unpause\\`, \\`is_paused\\` functions\n- Guarded all non-admin player/committee operations: \\`join_table\\`, \\`leave_table\\`, \\`start_hand\\`, \\`commit_deal\\`, \\`player_action\\`, \\`reveal_board\\`, \\`submit_showdown\\`, \\`claim_timeout\\`\n- Emits \\`table_paused\\` / \\`table_unpaused\\` events\n\n### \\`contracts/zk-verifier/src/lib.rs\\`\n- Added \\`ContractPaused = 12\\` to \\`VerifierError\\`\n- Added \\`Paused\\` variant to \\`StorageKey\\`\n- Added admin-only \\`pause\\`, \\`unpause\\`, \\`is_paused\\`\n- Guarded \\`verify_proof\\` (which is called by \\`verify_deal\\`, \\`verify_reveal\\`, \\`verify_showdown\\`)\n- Emits \\`verifier_paused\\` / \\`verifier_unpaused\\` events\n\n### \\`contracts/committee-registry/src/lib.rs\\`\n- Added \\`Paused\\` variant to \\`RegistryKey\\`\n- Added admin-only \\`pause\\`, \\`unpause\\`, \\`is_paused\\`\n- Guarded \\`register_member\\`, \\`deregister_member\\`, \\`create_epoch\\`, \\`report_slash\\`\n- Emits \\`registry_paused\\` / \\`registry_unpaused\\` events\n\n## Tests\n\n| Contract | New tests | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| zk-verifier | 4 | ✅ all pass |\n| committee-registry | 6 | ✅ all pass |\n| poker-table | 6 | ✅ compile correctly; pre-existing \\`invariants_test.rs\\` failures (#38) block \\`cargo test -p poker-table\\` but are unrelated to this change — \\`cargo check -p poker-table\\` passes clean |\n\nTests verify:\n- pause/unpause cycle works\n- paused state blocks player/committee operations with the correct error\n- admin read-only operations succeed while paused\n- unpause restores normal operation\n- non-admin cannot pause\n\n## Notes\nAs noted in the issue, a timelock or multi-sig requirement for \\`unpause\\` in production is recommended but is out of scope for this issue.\" 2>&1"
