              "args": {
                "command": "cd /home/marcus/StellPoker && gh pr create \\\n  --repo HitEmPoka/StellPoker \\\n  --head MarcusDavidG:feat/onchain-stats \\\n  --base main \\\n  --title \"feat: add onchain statistics — Horizon indexer, /api/stats, /stats page\" \\\n  --body \"Closes #19\n\n## Summary\n\nAdds a lightweight onchain statistics system: a background Horizon event indexer in the coordinator, a cached \\`GET /api/stats\\` endpoint, and a new \\`/stats\\` page in the frontend.\n\n## Events indexed\n\n| Event | Source | What it updates |\n|---|---|---|\n| \\`hand_started\\` | poker-table contract | \\`global.hands_played\\` |\n| \\`player_joined\\` | poker-table contract | \\`global.total_players_joined\\`, per-player \\`hands_played\\` |\n| \\`rake_withdrawn\\` | poker-table contract | \\`global.biggest_pot\\` (rake amount used as pot proxy) |\n\n## Changes\n\n### \\`services/coordinator/src/stats.rs\\` (new)\n- \\`StatsStore\\` — \\`Arc<RwLock<Inner>>\\` holding \\`GlobalStats\\` and per-player \\`PlayerStats\\`\n- \\`spawn_indexer()\\` — background task polling Horizon \\`/contract_events\\` every \\`STATS_POLL_SECONDS\\` (default 15s); advances a paging cursor so only new events are fetched\n- \\`get_stats()\\` — returns \\`StatsResponse\\` with a 30s in-memory TTL cache (avoids hammering Horizon on every HTTP request)\n\n### \\`services/coordinator/src/main.rs\\`\n- \\`StatsStore\\` added to \\`AppState\\`\n- Indexer spawned at startup when Soroban is configured; reads \\`HORIZON_URL\\` (default testnet) and \\`STATS_POLL_SECONDS\\`\n- New \\`GET /api/stats\\` route\n- **Fixed pre-existing build error**: \\`mod middleware as request_log\\` is not valid Rust syntax; replaced with \\`#[path = \\\"middleware.rs\\\"] mod request_log\\`\n\n### \\`app/src/lib/api.ts\\`\n- \\`GlobalStats\\`, \\`PlayerStats\\`, \\`StatsResponse\\` interfaces\n- \\`getStats()\\` client function\n\n### \\`app/src/app/stats/page.tsx\\` (new)\n- Three global stat cards: hands played, biggest pot (in XLM), total players\n- Top-10 leaderboard table: player address, hands won, hands played, biggest pot won\n- Auto-refreshes every 30s to stay in sync with server cache\n\n### \\`app/src/app/page.tsx\\`\n- Added a small \\`📊 STATS\\` link in the top-right corner of the home screen\n\n## Environment variables\n\n| Variable | Default | Purpose |\n|---|---|---|\n| \\`HORIZON_URL\\` | \\`https://horizon-testnet.stellar.org\\` | Horizon endpoint for event streaming |\n| \\`STATS_POLL_SECONDS\\` | \\`15\\` | How often the indexer polls Horizon |\" 2>&1"
